1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:05,086
Over mountains and across the valleys

2
00:00:05,447 --> 00:00:08,653
A ninja's body is like a plane, flying freely in the sky

3
00:00:08,905 --> 00:00:12,338
Honest and kind, Hattori is loved by all

4
00:00:12,492 --> 00:00:15,672
With wide round eyes and a tightly closed little mouth

5
00:00:16,005 --> 00:00:19,406
Concealing his face with a mask, cheeks puffed up

6
00:00:19,572 --> 00:00:22,730
Catching villains with agility, fast as lightning

7
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:26,497
Catching bad guys with clever tricks like magic

8
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:29,876
Speaking like poetry, polite and spirited

9
00:00:31,664 --> 00:00:33,895
"Kemumaki Sure Has a Way"

10
00:00:43,837 --> 00:00:45,344
What is this?

11
00:00:46,266 --> 00:00:47,647
It's a cricket! Oh

12
00:00:48,868 --> 00:00:49,693
Ouch!

13
00:00:49,734 --> 00:00:50,764
Good morning

14
00:00:50,804 --> 00:00:52,246
Good morning, Kenichi Mitsuba

15
00:00:52,286 --> 00:00:53,937
This cricket belongs to me

16
00:00:54,117 --> 00:00:55,089
You're so mean!

17
00:00:55,129 --> 00:00:56,570
I found this cricket first

18
00:00:56,610 --> 00:00:58,292
Finders keepers

19
00:00:58,332 --> 00:00:59,241
What's going on?

20
00:00:59,454 --> 00:01:00,939
What are you two doing here?

21
00:01:01,016 --> 00:01:02,124
Well, you see, sir

22
00:01:02,165 --> 00:01:02,890
The thing is...

23
00:01:02,931 --> 00:01:05,164
Kenichi Mitsuba was trying to stomp on this cricket

24
00:01:05,205 --> 00:01:07,634
I felt sorry for it, so I saved it

25
00:01:07,675 --> 00:01:08,908
Off you go now, go on...

26
00:01:08,948 --> 00:01:10,631
Kemumaki is such a good student

27
00:01:10,671 --> 00:01:11,512
But I...

28
00:01:11,552 --> 00:01:12,495
Kenichi!

29
00:01:12,536 --> 00:01:13,346
Yes, sir!

30
00:01:13,433 --> 00:01:15,593
Crickets are living creatures too, you know

31
00:01:15,633 --> 00:01:17,472
You ought to care for living things

32
00:01:17,512 --> 00:01:18,751
Just like Kemumaki

33
00:01:18,791 --> 00:01:19,830
You need to have a kind heart

34
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:20,549
Do you understand?

35
00:01:20,589 --> 00:01:22,179
Oh, but sir...

36
00:01:22,868 --> 00:01:24,591
Ugh, I can't believe him!

37
00:01:24,786 --> 00:01:25,585
Class

38
00:01:25,625 --> 00:01:26,864
Take out your textbooks now

39
00:01:26,904 --> 00:01:28,429
- Yes, sir
- Yes, sir

40
00:01:28,804 --> 00:01:29,910
Huh, it's not here?

41
00:01:29,958 --> 00:01:31,104
My books are gone?

42
00:01:31,144 --> 00:01:32,979
Kenichi, what's the matter?

43
00:01:33,146 --> 00:01:34,546
My books are missing

44
00:01:34,586 --> 00:01:35,827
Did you forget to bring your books?

45
00:01:35,867 --> 00:01:37,507
I'm sure I put them in my schoolbag this morning

46
00:01:37,547 --> 00:01:38,388
Teacher

47
00:01:38,428 --> 00:01:41,469
Let me lend my book to Kenichi for now

48
00:01:41,509 --> 00:01:42,802
Because Yumeko and I

49
00:01:42,842 --> 00:01:44,576
can easily share one

50
00:01:45,403 --> 00:01:47,904
That's why I say Kemumaki is such a good student

51
00:01:48,793 --> 00:01:50,594
When a classmate is in trouble

52
00:01:50,634 --> 00:01:52,223
you should really help them out

53
00:01:53,077 --> 00:01:55,695
Hey, that was my book!

54
00:01:55,815 --> 00:01:56,880
When did he take it?

55
00:01:56,921 --> 00:01:58,189
Mad, aren't you?

56
00:01:59,987 --> 00:02:01,625
Well? Feeling great, aren't you?

57
00:02:01,665 --> 00:02:03,743
Ugh, using this chance to get close to Yumeko!

58
00:02:07,104 --> 00:02:08,014
Hey, Kenichi

59
00:02:08,054 --> 00:02:09,495
I've been waiting for Hattori-kun to show up

60
00:02:09,535 --> 00:02:11,457
Too bad he hasn't shown up at all, right?

61
00:02:11,497 --> 00:02:14,621
Hattori doesn't follow me around 24 hours a day

62
00:02:14,661 --> 00:02:16,102
If Hattori didn't help you out

63
00:02:16,142 --> 00:02:17,223
you wouldn't be able to do a thing

64
00:02:17,263 --> 00:02:18,384
That's not true at all!

65
00:02:18,424 --> 00:02:19,284
No need to deny it

66
00:02:19,325 --> 00:02:21,027
It's all thanks to him giving you a hand

67
00:02:21,067 --> 00:02:24,051
To be honest, sometimes I actually find him really annoying

68
00:02:24,110 --> 00:02:24,871
Since that's the case...

69
00:02:24,911 --> 00:02:27,033
how about I, Kemumaki, chase him away for you?

70
00:02:27,073 --> 00:02:28,674
I don't need you meddling in my business!

71
00:02:35,219 --> 00:02:37,318
Hey, Kenichi, are you back from school?

72
00:02:39,263 --> 00:02:41,131
Did anything happen at school today?

73
00:02:41,172 --> 00:02:42,227
Tell me

74
00:02:42,267 --> 00:02:43,348
Nothing

75
00:02:43,394 --> 00:02:45,742
Did that Koga ninja Kemumaki bully you?

76
00:02:47,482 --> 00:02:48,886
If Hattori didn't help you out...

77
00:02:48,927 --> 00:02:50,868
you wouldn't be able to do a single thing

78
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,719
What on earth happened?

79
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:54,734
Stop nagging, it's none of your business!

80
00:02:55,157 --> 00:02:57,293
Who can help me do some shopping?

81
00:02:57,476 --> 00:02:58,915
Mom, let me go!

82
00:02:58,955 --> 00:03:00,076
I'll take care of it

83
00:03:01,354 --> 00:03:02,474
Wonders never cease!

84
00:03:02,514 --> 00:03:04,354
Kenichi is actually willing to help Mom with the shopping

85
00:03:04,394 --> 00:03:06,073
All right, you go ahead then

86
00:03:06,113 --> 00:03:08,354
Listen up, I'm not allowing any of you to follow me!

87
00:03:08,553 --> 00:03:11,349
Kenichi's attitude is really different from usual, huh?

88
00:03:15,838 --> 00:03:16,998
Shinzo!

89
00:03:17,953 --> 00:03:19,312
You spotted me?

90
00:03:21,143 --> 00:03:22,696
Is that Hattori?

91
00:03:23,695 --> 00:03:25,535
In the end, you noticed me

92
00:03:25,575 --> 00:03:27,655
Just how many times do I have to say it before you understand?

93
00:03:27,695 --> 00:03:29,174
I'm not letting you follow me!

94
00:03:31,208 --> 00:03:32,608
Big Brother...

95
00:03:32,735 --> 00:03:35,906
Boys just want to be on their own sometimes

96
00:03:44,890 --> 00:03:45,740
Oh, nice!

97
00:03:45,780 --> 00:03:47,184
Oh, nice catch!

98
00:03:47,304 --> 00:03:48,277
What do you want, Kemumaki?

99
00:03:48,317 --> 00:03:49,397
What is Hattori up to?

100
00:03:49,438 --> 00:03:50,559
Come on out, Hattori!

101
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:52,481
Hattori isn't even here!

102
00:03:52,962 --> 00:03:54,003
Well, that's weird

103
00:03:54,043 --> 00:03:55,645
Because he usually sticks to you like glue

104
00:03:55,685 --> 00:03:57,407
I can do things on my own sometimes too

105
00:03:57,447 --> 00:03:58,809
Do you get it now?

106
00:03:58,849 --> 00:04:00,731
Is that so? Go call Hattori over

107
00:04:00,771 --> 00:04:02,453
I'll be holding onto these groceries for now

108
00:04:02,493 --> 00:04:03,654
Give them back! Give them back!

109
00:04:03,694 --> 00:04:05,044
Hey, give them back!

110
00:04:07,043 --> 00:04:08,564
I'll be right back!

111
00:04:08,604 --> 00:04:10,277
Oh, are you two shopping together?

112
00:04:10,318 --> 00:04:11,277
Oh, it's Yumeko!

113
00:04:11,716 --> 00:04:12,644
Well, it's like this...

114
00:04:12,685 --> 00:04:15,086
Because the bags are heavy, I'm carrying them for Kenichi

115
00:04:15,594 --> 00:04:16,618
What a ridiculous excuse...

116
00:04:16,659 --> 00:04:17,606
Oh, that's not true!

117
00:04:17,660 --> 00:04:18,887
Kenichi, I'm really sorry!

118
00:04:18,927 --> 00:04:21,140
Here's your stuff back, I have to go help an old lady!

119
00:04:21,528 --> 00:04:22,648
Let me carry those for you

120
00:04:22,688 --> 00:04:23,848
Thank you so much!

121
00:04:23,889 --> 00:04:25,168
You're so sweet

122
00:04:25,209 --> 00:04:26,562
It's a pleasure to have you

123
00:04:26,699 --> 00:04:27,929
Kemumaki

124
00:04:27,969 --> 00:04:29,517
You're such a great help

125
00:04:31,289 --> 00:04:32,368
- Let's go
- Yumeko!

126
00:04:32,408 --> 00:04:35,419
It's so wonderful to have such a great classmate, isn't it?

127
00:04:35,586 --> 00:04:36,766
See you later

128
00:04:36,806 --> 00:04:39,084
Kemumaki is just awful

129
00:04:39,124 --> 00:04:41,802
Kemumaki is such a hypocrite

130
00:04:41,842 --> 00:04:44,401
Hattori-kun! Why are you here?

131
00:04:45,454 --> 00:04:47,681
I was worried, so I followed you

132
00:04:47,721 --> 00:04:48,881
If that's the case, Hattori-kun...

133
00:04:48,921 --> 00:04:50,482
Why didn't you show up earlier?

134
00:04:50,522 --> 00:04:51,732
Kenichi, let me ask you

135
00:04:51,773 --> 00:04:54,682
Why didn't you want me to meet Kemumaki?

136
00:04:54,889 --> 00:04:57,204
Because I didn't want to see you duel Kemumaki

137
00:04:57,244 --> 00:04:58,445
Someone might get hurt

138
00:04:58,485 --> 00:04:59,725
Is that so...

139
00:05:01,201 --> 00:05:01,981
Because...

140
00:05:02,021 --> 00:05:04,948
I want you guys to keep living at my house

141
00:05:05,081 --> 00:05:06,902
So you can't get hurt

142
00:05:07,289 --> 00:05:08,664
Is that why?

143
00:05:08,705 --> 00:05:10,371
Kenichi has such a good heart

144
00:05:10,412 --> 00:05:11,838
I'm so touched

145
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:14,532
You're so kind, I'm truly grateful

146
00:05:15,834 --> 00:05:17,995
Kemumaki is just terrible

147
00:05:18,035 --> 00:05:19,716
Picking on someone so kind

148
00:05:19,756 --> 00:05:21,352
I won't let you get away with this!

149
00:05:22,117 --> 00:05:24,038
Hattori-kun, let it go, please don't

150
00:05:24,078 --> 00:05:26,720
Don't worry, my brother's martial arts are amazing!

151
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:29,361
Kenichi, if we don't teach Kemumaki a lesson

152
00:05:29,401 --> 00:05:30,882
He'll keep bullying you

153
00:05:30,922 --> 00:05:32,523
So I have to put a stop to him

154
00:05:32,563 --> 00:05:33,900
Yeah, but...

155
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:35,245
Here he comes!

156
00:05:35,772 --> 00:05:37,084
Thank you so much for today

157
00:05:37,124 --> 00:05:38,317
Please send my regards to everyone

158
00:05:38,358 --> 00:05:39,601
Kemumaki is so sneaky

159
00:05:39,641 --> 00:05:41,159
Getting Yumeko to treat him so nicely too

160
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:42,594
Yan...

161
00:05:45,395 --> 00:05:47,257
Oh, he even managed to get some pastries!

162
00:05:47,298 --> 00:05:50,774
All right, I'll expose his true colors!

163
00:05:50,979 --> 00:05:52,472
Yan...

164
00:05:53,191 --> 00:05:55,077
It's that dog from earlier, what's wrong?

165
00:05:58,459 --> 00:06:00,739
Did it hurt when he stepped on you?

166
00:06:00,779 --> 00:06:03,099
He's my classmate, Kenichi

167
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:05,146
I'm really sorry about that

168
00:06:06,918 --> 00:06:08,179
Here, you can have this

169
00:06:08,219 --> 00:06:10,259
Yumeko gave this pastry to me

170
00:06:12,178 --> 00:06:14,122
All right, take care now

171
00:06:19,462 --> 00:06:22,534
Who knew Kemumaki had a kind heart too?

172
00:06:22,574 --> 00:06:25,554
Even though he's my rival, I still respect him

173
00:06:28,518 --> 00:06:30,838
"Tired of Eating Potatoes"

174
00:06:33,463 --> 00:06:35,863
Woah, what could be the reason?

175
00:06:36,183 --> 00:06:38,329
Why have they all withered up?

176
00:06:39,286 --> 00:06:41,430
Does it have something to do with the fertilizer?

177
00:06:41,470 --> 00:06:43,298
I need to discuss this with Dad

178
00:06:43,732 --> 00:06:45,187
Yan...

179
00:06:45,653 --> 00:06:47,773
We need to find a way to help out

180
00:06:47,813 --> 00:06:50,265
Since we've been imposing on Kenichi's family for so long

181
00:06:50,306 --> 00:06:52,378
We really ought to do our best

182
00:06:52,774 --> 00:06:54,895
-I'm home
-Dad, you're back?

183
00:06:54,935 --> 00:06:55,978
Yeah...

184
00:06:56,735 --> 00:06:58,064
Dad, what are these?

185
00:06:58,105 --> 00:07:00,425
Oh, well, I won my golf game

186
00:07:00,466 --> 00:07:01,576
These are the prizes

187
00:07:03,488 --> 00:07:04,888
Hooray!

188
00:07:05,018 --> 00:07:06,448
Are they potatoes?

189
00:07:07,658 --> 00:07:10,487
Then we can save on groceries from now on

190
00:07:10,883 --> 00:07:12,604
-Let's eat
-Let's eat

191
00:07:17,568 --> 00:07:18,808
It's delicious!

192
00:07:19,093 --> 00:07:21,613
All right, here you go, eat up

193
00:07:22,071 --> 00:07:24,105
You have to eat well to stay healthy

194
00:07:24,145 --> 00:07:24,910
-Okay
-Okay

195
00:07:24,951 --> 00:07:26,398
It's really yummy!

196
00:07:33,128 --> 00:07:34,479
Kenichi, what's wrong?

197
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:36,479
If you don't hurry and eat, you'll be late

198
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:38,160
We had so many potatoes last night

199
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,761
This morning it's potato soup again

200
00:07:39,801 --> 00:07:41,432
Plus stewed potatoes and fried potatoes

201
00:07:41,473 --> 00:07:43,002
I'm sick of them

202
00:07:43,048 --> 00:07:44,779
Just looking at them makes me full

203
00:07:45,203 --> 00:07:48,084
Man, I really don't feel like eating breakfast this morning

204
00:07:48,124 --> 00:07:49,805
How can you skip breakfast?

205
00:07:49,845 --> 00:07:51,746
Going to school is like going into battle

206
00:07:51,787 --> 00:07:54,006
If you're hungry, how can you win on the battlefield?

207
00:07:54,046 --> 00:07:56,127
That's easy for you to say, but...

208
00:08:00,010 --> 00:08:01,260
Please let class end soon...

209
00:08:01,502 --> 00:08:02,540
For this math problem

210
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:04,740
we already know the lengths of AB and BC

211
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,137
What about the third side?

212
00:08:06,819 --> 00:08:07,658
Kenichi?

213
00:08:07,698 --> 00:08:08,578
Ah, yes...

214
00:08:08,811 --> 00:08:11,438
I know it's 12:07!

215
00:08:13,454 --> 00:08:15,224
You're daydreaming, aren't you?

216
00:08:15,265 --> 00:08:17,347
Outrageous! Stand up as punishment!

217
00:08:17,512 --> 00:08:18,534
Yes, sir

218
00:08:24,784 --> 00:08:26,677
Yay, lunch time!

219
00:08:28,156 --> 00:08:29,797
What's the matter, Kenichi?

220
00:08:30,438 --> 00:08:31,848
Is something wrong?

221
00:08:31,889 --> 00:08:34,532
Nothing, it's just potato salad...

222
00:08:34,681 --> 00:08:37,163
I see, do you think there's not enough salad?

223
00:08:37,203 --> 00:08:39,117
All right, I'll share some more with you

224
00:08:39,256 --> 00:08:40,164
Oh, no!

225
00:08:40,205 --> 00:08:42,239
No, please don't!

226
00:08:44,574 --> 00:08:45,513
You don't even know how to play

227
00:08:45,553 --> 00:08:47,555
Then I'll play better next time

228
00:08:47,996 --> 00:08:49,481
What is it, Shinzo?

229
00:08:49,677 --> 00:08:51,594
I smell something really good

230
00:08:53,088 --> 00:08:55,683
It really smells good, could it be tonight's dinner?

231
00:08:55,723 --> 00:08:58,446
If it is, then maybe we're not having potatoes tonight

232
00:08:58,486 --> 00:09:00,407
Hooray...

233
00:09:00,448 --> 00:09:02,170
Speaking of food

234
00:09:02,210 --> 00:09:04,292
my stomach's rumbling like a drum now

235
00:09:04,332 --> 00:09:05,783
Mine too

236
00:09:08,575 --> 00:09:10,856
Hattori-kun, what are you doing here?

237
00:09:11,203 --> 00:09:14,125
Oh, it's you, Dad, why are you home so early?

238
00:09:14,166 --> 00:09:16,177
Do you know what I'm practicing?

239
00:09:16,217 --> 00:09:18,578
It's the Earth Burrowing Ninja Technique

240
00:09:19,418 --> 00:09:21,459
-Dad, you're back?
-Yeah

241
00:09:21,499 --> 00:09:23,741
You two, hurry inside for dinner

242
00:09:23,781 --> 00:09:25,902
Mom, are we having teppanyaki tonight?

243
00:09:25,942 --> 00:09:26,647
Yes, we are

244
00:09:26,688 --> 00:09:27,662
Yay, awesome!

245
00:09:27,703 --> 00:09:29,774
Teppanyaki is my absolute favorite

246
00:09:30,222 --> 00:09:30,922
Awesome!

247
00:09:30,963 --> 00:09:31,986
Can we get seconds?

248
00:09:32,027 --> 00:09:32,918
Of course you can

249
00:09:32,958 --> 00:09:35,026
I made plenty, eat all you want

250
00:09:35,067 --> 00:09:35,777
- Yay!
- Yay!

251
00:09:35,818 --> 00:09:37,538
All right, it's ready to eat

252
00:09:37,909 --> 00:09:39,270
Here, eat up

253
00:09:39,497 --> 00:09:40,811
Time to dig in

254
00:09:41,552 --> 00:09:42,139
Let's eat

255
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:43,794
How does it taste?

256
00:09:43,834 --> 00:09:45,675
Oh dear, what are the ingredients?

257
00:09:45,715 --> 00:09:47,292
It's... it's potatoes again?

258
00:09:47,333 --> 00:09:48,665
Are they really potatoes?

259
00:09:48,706 --> 00:09:49,507
That's right

260
00:09:49,547 --> 00:09:52,557
This is teppanyaki potato, with potatoes as the main dish

261
00:09:53,063 --> 00:09:54,663
It's delicious!

262
00:09:57,592 --> 00:10:00,159
Ugh, I'm too hungry to sleep

263
00:10:00,953 --> 00:10:02,570
Kenichi, the way things look

264
00:10:02,611 --> 00:10:04,945
Tomorrow's breakfast will be potatoes again

265
00:10:04,994 --> 00:10:06,082
Why wait until tomorrow morning?

266
00:10:06,122 --> 00:10:07,714
I'm already dreaming about potatoes right now

267
00:10:07,754 --> 00:10:09,378
Let's think of a plan

268
00:10:12,941 --> 00:10:15,110
That's right, doing this is super easy

269
00:10:15,151 --> 00:10:16,618
Shinzo, what do you want to do?

270
00:10:16,658 --> 00:10:17,671
Like this

271
00:10:17,857 --> 00:10:19,150
And like this...

272
00:10:20,974 --> 00:10:22,806
Let's definitely do that

273
00:10:34,177 --> 00:10:36,350
It's almost ready

274
00:10:52,384 --> 00:10:54,504
And now everything is all done

275
00:11:06,489 --> 00:11:08,267
- All set, let's head back
- Okay

276
00:11:08,629 --> 00:11:10,024
Let's go back, let's go back

277
00:11:17,399 --> 00:11:18,469
Add a bit more fertilizer

278
00:11:18,509 --> 00:11:20,741
Everyone will be so amazed tomorrow morning

279
00:11:23,277 --> 00:11:24,801
How strange

280
00:11:25,085 --> 00:11:26,140
What's wrong, Mom?

281
00:11:26,181 --> 00:11:28,149
All the potatoes are gone

282
00:11:28,189 --> 00:11:30,473
I wonder if a thief stole them

283
00:11:30,620 --> 00:11:32,187
A thief must have stolen them!

284
00:11:32,227 --> 00:11:33,292
That really is strange

285
00:11:33,333 --> 00:11:35,506
Of all things, why would a thief steal potatoes?

286
00:11:35,546 --> 00:11:37,084
Don't you think that's odd?

287
00:11:37,125 --> 00:11:39,145
It doesn't really matter, potatoes are no big deal

288
00:11:39,186 --> 00:11:40,876
If they're gone, we just won't eat them then

289
00:11:40,917 --> 00:11:43,157
Dad is truly Dad, he always speaks so sensibly

290
00:11:43,198 --> 00:11:44,492
However...

291
00:11:45,463 --> 00:11:46,876
Mom, don't worry

292
00:11:46,917 --> 00:11:49,832
Shishimaru is barking loudly, looks like he found the potatoes

293
00:11:51,372 --> 00:11:52,633
How could that be?

294
00:11:52,674 --> 00:11:54,234
Oh no, this is bad...

295
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:01,265
I cast a ninja technique to make the trees grow fast

296
00:12:01,306 --> 00:12:02,967
I didn't expect it to actually work!

297
00:12:03,007 --> 00:12:04,449
Thank you so much, Hattori-kun

298
00:12:04,489 --> 00:12:06,290
You made the potatoes grow so quickly

299
00:12:06,394 --> 00:12:09,265
With this many potatoes, we have enough to eat for at least a year

300
00:12:10,583 --> 00:12:13,512
Oh no, I'm terrified at the sight of potatoes!

301
00:12:14,211 --> 00:12:17,385
Mom, tonight I want to eat
potato croquettes

302
00:12:17,425 --> 00:12:18,484
Sure

303
00:12:18,525 --> 00:12:20,787
I know they'll be delicious

304
00:12:20,827 --> 00:12:23,800
-Oh no
-Yan...

305
00:12:26,325 --> 00:12:28,879
"Forgot the Textbook"

306
00:12:30,496 --> 00:12:33,476
Ling...

307
00:12:48,143 --> 00:12:49,594
Shinzo, it's your turn

308
00:12:50,063 --> 00:12:51,330
You found it?

309
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:54,859
Then I'm counting on you

310
00:12:54,899 --> 00:12:56,610
I know what to do

311
00:12:58,205 --> 00:13:00,928
He's so scatterbrained, forgetting his book like that

312
00:13:00,968 --> 00:13:01,909
Hey, what are you doing?

313
00:13:01,950 --> 00:13:03,861
I want to go to school too

314
00:13:03,928 --> 00:13:05,381
I'm coming along too

315
00:13:05,614 --> 00:13:07,176
You can't... Just go back

316
00:13:07,216 --> 00:13:09,200
Go back right now, hurry

317
00:13:09,317 --> 00:13:14,532
-Yan...
-Ling...

318
00:13:15,793 --> 00:13:17,400
Oh no, they're gone!

319
00:13:18,565 --> 00:13:19,805
They ditched me!

320
00:13:19,943 --> 00:13:21,850
Hey, that's not fair!

321
00:13:25,453 --> 00:13:27,543
Big brother really knows what he's doing

322
00:13:30,404 --> 00:13:32,086
Oh no, this is bad

323
00:13:35,925 --> 00:13:39,144
That's right, Kenichi's classroom is right above here

324
00:13:41,011 --> 00:13:42,397
Yan...

325
00:13:44,524 --> 00:13:47,337
Sigh, inexperienced ninjas are always so clumsy

326
00:13:47,378 --> 00:13:48,941
Yan...

327
00:13:49,601 --> 00:13:50,490
Hold onto the rope tightly

328
00:13:50,531 --> 00:13:52,381
Thanks a lot, Big Brother

329
00:13:52,422 --> 00:13:54,333
Yan...

330
00:13:59,387 --> 00:14:00,649
Yan...

331
00:14:01,180 --> 00:14:02,461
Good morning, class

332
00:14:02,501 --> 00:14:03,863
-Good morning
-Good morning, teacher

333
00:14:03,909 --> 00:14:06,341
Oh man, what should I do now?

334
00:14:09,756 --> 00:14:11,003
It's Hattori-kun!

335
00:14:11,797 --> 00:14:12,716
Don't worry

336
00:14:12,756 --> 00:14:14,840
I brought the book

337
00:14:14,881 --> 00:14:15,734
Yan...

338
00:14:16,394 --> 00:14:18,311
That's a relief

339
00:14:19,432 --> 00:14:20,232
Kenichi

340
00:14:20,272 --> 00:14:21,795
What were you just saying?

341
00:14:21,977 --> 00:14:24,110
Nothing... I didn't say anything

342
00:14:24,150 --> 00:14:26,108
Hurry up and pass the book to Kenichi

343
00:14:26,148 --> 00:14:28,362
He's going to get in trouble, hurry

344
00:14:28,587 --> 00:14:30,092
Yan...

345
00:14:31,761 --> 00:14:32,768
Yan...

346
00:14:32,809 --> 00:14:35,048
All right, I'll read it once for everyone

347
00:14:35,088 --> 00:14:36,954
Listen quietly, everyone

348
00:14:37,965 --> 00:14:39,964
When my round-the-world trip came to an end...

349
00:14:40,005 --> 00:14:41,404
Slower with your hands

350
00:14:41,444 --> 00:14:42,643
All right, be careful

351
00:14:42,683 --> 00:14:44,828
Lower it down slowly, slowly

352
00:14:44,869 --> 00:14:46,476
...there were so many people there to meet the ship

353
00:14:46,582 --> 00:14:48,083
Everyone was overjoyed

354
00:14:48,123 --> 00:14:50,086
Because they were reuniting with their loved ones, you see

355
00:14:50,126 --> 00:14:50,980
At that time...

356
00:14:51,021 --> 00:14:53,131
Wow, so many people, a huge crowd

357
00:14:53,710 --> 00:14:54,712
People reuniting with their loved ones...

358
00:14:54,753 --> 00:14:57,483
Steady now, lower it down slowly

359
00:15:06,597 --> 00:15:07,798
Kenichi, what's the matter?

360
00:15:08,064 --> 00:15:08,727
Nothing

361
00:15:08,767 --> 00:15:10,409
Why is it so noisy during class?

362
00:15:11,772 --> 00:15:13,028
Shut up!

363
00:15:15,859 --> 00:15:17,522
You'd better spit it out right now!

364
00:15:19,852 --> 00:15:22,368
Stop nagging, mind your own business!

365
00:15:22,408 --> 00:15:24,916
What did you say? Being so rude to a teacher, huh?

366
00:15:25,037 --> 00:15:26,243
I didn't, I didn't say that!

367
00:15:26,290 --> 00:15:27,457
You clearly did!

368
00:15:27,691 --> 00:15:30,321
Yeah, I said it, so what?

369
00:15:32,868 --> 00:15:35,260
Being so disrespectful to the teacher, outrageous!

370
00:15:35,475 --> 00:15:36,655
It wasn't me!

371
00:15:36,696 --> 00:15:38,383
So what if I did?

372
00:15:38,897 --> 00:15:41,242
Aargh, you're driving me crazy!

373
00:15:41,451 --> 00:15:43,852
He's using the ninja Voice Shifting Technique!

374
00:15:43,900 --> 00:15:45,622
Kemumaki is despicable!

375
00:15:45,662 --> 00:15:47,463
All right, let me teach him a lesson

376
00:15:47,503 --> 00:15:51,157
Kemumaki, you really are way too despicable!

377
00:15:51,946 --> 00:15:53,026
You rascal!

378
00:15:53,066 --> 00:15:54,974
I'm going to teach you a lesson today...

379
00:15:57,109 --> 00:15:59,268
Kemumaki, you really are so despicable!

380
00:16:01,031 --> 00:16:03,831
How dare you mess with Kenichi, I won't let you get away with this!

381
00:16:04,574 --> 00:16:06,533
Kemumaki, I challenge you to a fair duel right now!

382
00:16:06,574 --> 00:16:08,695
What a rascal, you dare prank me?

383
00:16:08,787 --> 00:16:10,955
Fine, wait for me at the playground right now!

384
00:16:14,622 --> 00:16:16,741
Iga ninja truly are the absolute worst!

385
00:16:16,781 --> 00:16:18,075
I'll teach you a lesson!

386
00:16:18,142 --> 00:16:20,490
Teacher, I need to go to the bathroom!

387
00:16:20,543 --> 00:16:22,230
Please excuse me

388
00:16:23,164 --> 00:16:25,219
-Yan...
-Aargh!

389
00:16:25,346 --> 00:16:27,347
Oh no, big brother, what should I do?

390
00:16:27,587 --> 00:16:30,220
I don't know how to give Kenichi his books

391
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:31,232
This is so frustrating!

392
00:16:36,512 --> 00:16:38,276
Listen up, Hattori-kun of the Iga clan!

393
00:16:38,316 --> 00:16:40,119
I'm definitely teaching you a lesson today!

394
00:16:40,159 --> 00:16:42,442
Bring it on, I'd like to see you try!

395
00:16:45,365 --> 00:16:47,324
Yan...

396
00:16:48,769 --> 00:16:50,043
Yan...

397
00:16:52,774 --> 00:16:54,247
Outrageous!

398
00:16:54,288 --> 00:16:55,975
Same to you!

399
00:16:57,071 --> 00:16:59,398
Look, someone's dueling on the sports field!

400
00:16:59,438 --> 00:17:00,430
Really?

401
00:17:01,800 --> 00:17:03,746
Oh, it's Hattori-kun!

402
00:17:06,373 --> 00:17:07,817
Go for it...

403
00:17:09,266 --> 00:17:10,146
How outrageous!

404
00:17:10,187 --> 00:17:11,506
Which students are being so naughty?

405
00:17:11,553 --> 00:17:14,093
Fighting during class time, huh?

406
00:17:15,172 --> 00:17:17,965
That's right, I'll take this chance to get the book back!

407
00:17:18,312 --> 00:17:20,152
Hey, stop fighting right now!

408
00:17:26,502 --> 00:17:27,520
Who's that?

409
00:17:27,561 --> 00:17:28,649
Oh no, Shinzo!

410
00:17:28,690 --> 00:17:30,178
Oh no, I'm falling...

411
00:17:30,218 --> 00:17:31,538
No way, I'm falling!

412
00:17:31,578 --> 00:17:34,457
Oh no, I'm scared, ahhh...

413
00:17:35,618 --> 00:17:36,343
Shinzo!

414
00:17:36,384 --> 00:17:38,064
Oh dear, are you all right? You're not hurt, right?

415
00:17:57,005 --> 00:17:58,564
Hey, the book is here?

416
00:17:59,651 --> 00:18:01,932
Kenichi, your book is right here!

417
00:18:02,469 --> 00:18:03,753
Big brother!

418
00:18:03,832 --> 00:18:06,397
I've already given the book to Kenichi!

419
00:18:12,637 --> 00:18:15,323
Shinzo's crying was exceptionally loud today

420
00:18:15,364 --> 00:18:17,725
It almost burst my eardrums!
